WHY THERE IS NO index.html HERE. tests/webapi_platform.mk:67 globs
`tests/fixtures/webapi/*/index.html` into WEBAPI_FIXTURES, which is the corpus
`make probe-webapi` ranks missing globals over. That instrument's premise is
that every page in it is bytes a real site served; a synthetic page in the
ranking would be this tree telling itself what the web asks for. The page here
